{title: Hosanna (FJ_40_en)}
{song_number: 40}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[E]I see the King of glory [C#m]coming on the clouds with fire.
The whole earth shakes, [F#m7]the whole earth shakes. [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[E]I see His love and mercy [C#m]washing over all our sin.
The people sing, [F#m7]the people sing. [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E/G#]Hosanna, [A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna in the [C#m7]highest!
[A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna, [E/G#]Hosanna in the [A]highest! [C#m7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[E]I see a generation [C#m]rising up to take their place
with selfless faith, [F#m7]with selfless faith. [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[E]I see a near revival [C#m]stirring as we pray and seek.
We're on our knees, [F#m7]we're on our knees. [B]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E/G#]Hosanna, [A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna in the [C#m7]highest!
[A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna, [E/G#]Hosanna in the [A]highest! [C#m7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[A]Heal my heart and make it clean, [B]
[E]open up my eyes to the things un[C#m]seen.
[A]Break my heart for what breaks Yours, [B]
[E]everything I am for Your [C#m]Kingdom's cause.
[A]Show me how to love like [B]You have loved me.
[A]As I walk from earth in[B]to eterni[C#m]ty. [E]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[E/G#]Hosanna, [A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna in the [C#m7]highest!
[A]Hosanna, [B]Hosanna, [E/G#]Hosanna in the [A]highest! [C#m7]
{end_of_chorus}
